    "font" : "Verdana",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "To enable the Contracting Authority to verify the access, each tenderer must indicate its country of establishment (and in case of joint tender – the country of establishment of each group member) and must present the supporting evidence indicated below. The same document(s) could be used to prove country/-ies of establishment and the delegation(s) of the authorisation to sign as described in section 4.3 ."
