    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 70.0, 206.92, 526.333, 247.92 ],
    "font" : "Verdana",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Any economic operator willing to submit a tender for this call for tenders must be registered in the Participant Register   an online register of organizations and natural persons participating in European Commission's calls for tenders or proposals (participants)."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 44,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 69.667, 145.587, 527.0, 197.253 ],
    "font" : "Verdana",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "On registering each participant obtains a Participant Identification Code (PIC, 9-digit number) which acts as its unique identifier in the Participant Register. A participant needs to register only once – the information provided can be further updated or re-used by the participant in other European Chemicals Agency's calls for tenders."
